  "description": "Mongoose was born from BMX racing with products that push the limits of what a rider can do on the track. Our latest line of BMX race bikes, the Title series, have been designed using that same race pedigree. Designed for beginner-level riders, the Mongoose Title Mini gives you a trophy-worthy bike at an amazingly affordable price!\nLightweight Tectonic T1 aluminum frame, integrated headset, and internal cable routing. 17.5” top tube length and frame weight of 2.69 lbs.\nDrivetrain features 140mm 3-piece tubular chromoly cranks with a 39T chainring and euro cartridge bottom bracket.\nArisun XLR8 20” x 1-1/8\" tires mounted on Xposure aluminum double wall rims with aluminum ball bearing front hub and 16T cog freewheel rear hub.\nHi-Ten steel handlebar (2.5\") and fork, 30mm stem, sealed bearing headset, and alloy V-brake and brake levers, Suggested rider height is 4'2\" to 4'10\".",
